    "title": "Chinatown Lion Statue",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10335910",
    "publication_date": "2016-09-23",
    "description": "In Vancouver's Chinatown, outside the Dr. Sun Yat-Sen Classical Chinese Garden, sits two of these stone Shi, Chinese guardian lion statues.\n\nRecently a pair of rose quartz lion statues (not the one depicted here) was stolen from the garden. They mysteriously reappeared a week later. Uploading this photogrammetry capture in case the thieves strike again.\n\nSource: Objaverse 1.0 / Sketchfab",
